      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD said to Jacob, Return to the land of thy fathers, and to thy kindred; and I will be with thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jacob sent and called Rachel and Leah into the field to his flock,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And said to them, I see your father's countenance, that it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not towards me as before: but the God of my father hath been with me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ye know that with all my power I have served your father.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And your father hath deceived me, and changed my wages ten times: but God suffered him not to hurt me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If he said thus, The speckled shall be thy wages; then all the cattle bore speckled: and if he said thus, The ring-streaked shall be thy hire; then all the cattle bore ring-streaked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus God hath taken away the cattle of your father, and given ",
