      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then Jacob arose, and set his sons and his wives upon camels;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he carried away all his cattle, and all his goods which he had gained, the cattle of his getting, which he had gained in Padan-aram; to go to Isaac, his father, in the land of Canaan.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Laban went to shear his sheep; and Rachel had stolen the images that ",
