        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " her father's.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jacob stole away unawares to Laban the Syrian, in that he told him not that he was about to depart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.31.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.31.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So he fled with all that he had; and he arose, and passed over the river, and set his face ",
